      "created_at": "2023-06-05T22:57:32.934Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi, I have just found a potential bug in LDAP integration.</p>\n<p>LDAP integration does not import the groups as configured in the mapped of module integration, and thus no roles are assigned accordingly.</p>\n<p>I tried somehow to view the log to check what is going on in developer mode, but I found nothing useful or related to LDAP in the log.</p>\n<p>Could you body help how to debug this? Or maybe fix it?</p>\n<p>I can provide access to my ERPNext instance if needed.</p>\n<p>Basically I followed this doc to configure LDAP:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://frappeframework.com/docs/v14/user/en/integration/ldap-integration\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Setting up LDAP (frappeframework.com)</a></p>\n<p>APPLICATION VERSION<br>\nv14.26.0</p>\n<p>HELM CHART VERSIONS<br>\n6.0.38<br>\n(31 May, 2023)</p>\n<p>Here are my settings for the LDAP integration:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/1/61a40321217fdba982f79501df42d6f2d57d7d10.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/61a40321217fdba982f79501df42d6f2d57d7d10\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/1/61a40321217fdba982f79501df42d6f2d57d7d10_2_448x499.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"dVLHYb2STTMDlyYH1bRzQ7ILQ1q\" width=\"448\" height=\"499\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/1/61a40321217fdba982f79501df42d6f2d57d7d10_2_448x499.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/1/61a40321217fdba982f79501df42d6f2d57d7d10_2_672x748.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/1/61a40321217fdba982f79501df42d6f2d57d7d10_2_896x998.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F9F9\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1040×1160 72.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/a/aa1c0f20eb5eafabf2b404dd8235d1fee5da1fe9.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/aa1c0f20eb5eafabf2b404dd8235d1fee5da1fe9\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/a/aa1c0f20eb5eafabf2b404dd8235d1fee5da1fe9_2_651x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"ogRhKAg95f0ew7VWMc6zzdBJepr\" width=\"651\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/a/aa1c0f20eb5eafabf2b404dd8235d1fee5da1fe9_2_651x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/a/aa1c0f20eb5eafabf2b404dd8235d1fee5da1fe9_2_976x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/a/aa1c0f20eb5eafabf2b404dd8235d1fee5da1fe9.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1065×817 49.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>I tried also with a single exitence of Domain Users, the same, no roles are assigned as mapped here.</p>",
